anywhere inside `_load` and report it to callers as a record that does not exist.
It also notes the type inherits both `TrustPlaneStoreError` and `KeyError`, so
broad-catching callers are unaffected.

TRAP — the reason a token-matching read misfires here: a bare `except KeyError` is
present in the excerpt, quoted as a retained code block, wrapping
